## Never
- Run anything against the production database or production services.
- Print, log, commit, or paste secrets, keys, tokens, or customer data. Browser code may only use public keys.
- Disable checks, tests, signature verification, or security rules to make something pass.
- Edit these paths: {{protected_paths}}

